("v21", "scalar", "Create one premium hand-painted raster emblem for Claimipedia Science, a scientific inquiry application on a dark midnight-blue personal website. A beautifully crafted antique brass microscope with a luminous pale-cyan optical lens studies a small faceted blue-violet crystal on its stage. A restrained circular brass armillary frame and a few connected points evoke models and evidence. Match a painterly, tactile illuminated-manuscript fantasy instrument aesthetic: real brass patina, exquisite glass reflections, detailed materials, warm gold edge-light and cool azure inner light. Readable, confident silhouette at 96–128 pixels. Single centered object, full object visible, generous clear transparent margin. Transparent background with genuine alpha, no square backdrop, no environment, no text, no letters, no UI, no drop-shadow rectangle. This is an icon asset, not a logo wordmark or scientific diagram. High quality PNG.")
