("v34", "scalar", "A premium hand-painted raster emblem for Creator Studio, a creative authoring workspace on a dark midnight-blue website. A small antique brass writing desk holds an open cream sketchbook and a graceful rose-gold quill; above the pages float three small translucent luminous panes suggesting a drawing, a sequence of film frames, and a branching story. One elegant coherent object, not a collage. Painterly fantasy instrument aesthetic, exquisite tactile brass and paper, soft rose and apricot light, restrained glints, confident silhouette readable at 64–96 pixels. Full object centered with generous clear transparent margin. Genuine transparent alpha background. No text, no letters, no environment, no rectangular backdrop, no words or UI. High quality PNG.")
